We thank Darwin Geospatial for infrastructure support for this research and for open-sourcing the code and experiments. The Portuguese land-cover statistics derive from BigEarthNet~V2, which contains modified Copernicus Sentinel data (2017--2018); we acknowledge the European Space Agency and the European Commission Copernicus programme. We also thank Guillermo Perez for his contributions during his internship at Darwin Geospatial.
